harmacokinetics Profile: Maximum Plasma Concentration (Cmax)","description":"Cmax is the maximum (peak) observed plasma drug concentration after single dose administration (mass x volume-1).\n\nPK assessment parameters were determined using the actual recorded sampling times and non-compartmental methods.\n\nIn Cohort 2, patients were supposed to be orally administered iptacopan 50 mg b.i.d. in addition to SoC; this was increased to iptacopan 200 mg b.i.d. at study day 15 or at any time later in the study if LDH was not within limit of normal or reduced by at least 60% as compared to baseline values. One patient in Cohort 2 was orally administered iptacopan 25 mg at day 1 due to a dosing error.","populationDescription":"The overall number of participants analyzed represents the participants in the PK analysis set.\n\nThe Pharmacokinetic (PK) analysis set is defined as patients with at least one available valid PK concentration measurement, who received any study drug and with no protocol deviations that impact on PK data.\n\nThe number analyzed per row represents the participants with a valid Cmax value for that particular visit.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"MEAN","dispersionType":"Standard Deviation","unitOfMeasure":"ng/mL","timeFrame":"Day 1, 29, 169, 337","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Cohort 1: LNP023 200mg Bid + SoC","description":"Orally administered iptacopan 200 mg b.i.d. in Part 1 and Part 2 in addition to SoC."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Cohort 2: LNP023 25mg Bid + SoC","description":"Orally administered iptacopan 25 mg b.i.d. at the respective visit due to dosing error"},{"id":"OG002","title":"Cohort 2: LNP023 50mg Bid + SoC","description":"Orally administered iptacopan 50 mg b.i.d. at the respective visit"},{"id":"OG003","title":"Cohort 2: LNP023 200mg Bid + SoC","description":"Orally administered iptacopan 200 mg b.i.d. at the respective visit"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"},{"groupId":"OG001","