opan 200 mg b.i.d. at study day 15 or at any time later in the study if LDH was not within limit of normal or reduced by at least 60% as compared to baseline values. One patient in Cohort 2 was orally administered iptacopan 25 mg at day 1 due to a dosing error.","populationDescription":"The overall number of participants analyzed represents the participants in the PK analysis set.\n\nThe number analyzed per row represents the participants with a valid AUCtau value for that particular visit.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"MEAN","dispersionType":"Standard Deviation","unitOfMeasure":"h*ng/mL","timeFrame":"day 1, 29, 169, 337","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Cohort 1: LNP023 200mg Bid + SoC","description":"Orally administered iptacopan 200 mg b.i.d. in Part 1 and Part 2 in addition to SoC."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Cohort 2: LNP023 25mg Bid + SoC","description":"Orally administered iptacopan 25 mg b.i.d. at the respective visit due to dosing error"},{"id":"OG002","title":"Cohort 2: LNP023 50mg Bid + SoC","description":"Orally administered iptacopan 50 mg b.i.d. at the respective visit"},{"id":"OG003","title":"Cohort 2: LNP023 200mg Bid + SoC","description":"Orally administered iptacopan 200 mg b.i.d. at the respective visit"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"1"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"6"},{"groupId":"OG003","value":"3"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Day 1","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"1"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"5"},{"groupId":"OG003","value":"0"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"18200","spread":"6700"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"9470"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"8620","spread":"1310"}]}]},{"title":"Day 29","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"0"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"6"},{"groupId":"OG003","value":"0"}]}],